Dialogue: 30,0:00:05.48,0:00:08.74,Dialogue Top Italics,Gi,0,0,0,,Fourteen commercial buildings were either partially or completely destroyed.
Dialogue: 30,0:00:09.20,0:00:11.20,Dialogue Italics,Gi,0,0,0,,Six other sectors were damaged, as well.
Dialogue: 30,0:00:11.20,0:00:14.04,Dialogue Italics,Gi,0,0,0,,In addition, the underground lifelines were affected,
Dialogue: 30,0:00:14.04,0:00:16.25,Dialogue Italics,Gi,0,0,0,,but they will be repaired soon.
Dialogue: 30,0:00:16.54,0:00:19.75,Dialogue Italics,Gi,0,0,0,,We were lucky the enemy landed in a commercial area.
Dialogue: 30,0:00:20.04,0:00:22.54,Dialogue Italics,Gi,0,0,0,,Not many people were out since it was a weekday afternoon,
Dialogue: 30,0:00:22.54,0:00:25.50,Dialogue Italics,Gi,0,0,0,,which kept casualties to a minimum.
Dialogue: 30,0:00:27.88,0:00:28.63,Dialogue,Y,0,0,0,,Kizuna!
Dialogue: 30,0:00:28.63,0:00:29.76,Dialogue,H,0,0,0,,Kizuna-kun!
Dialogue: 30,0:00:38.68,0:00:40.27,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,I'm back, everyone.
Dialogue: 30,0:00:40.69,0:00:42.48,Dialogue,R,0,0,0,,Are your injuries all right now?
Dialogue: 30,0:00:42.48,0:00:43.44,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 30,0:00:43.44,0:00:45.27,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,I can't stay in bed any longer.
Dialogue: 30,0:00:47.82,0:00:51.53,Dialogue,R,0,0,0,,She was far stronger than Aldea, the one you fought in Guam.
Dialogue: 30,0:00:52.53,0:00:54.78,Dialogue,R,0,0,0,,For now, I want to wait for further analysis on the
Dialogue: 30,0:00:54.78,0:00:56.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Magitech armor and combat capabilities
Dialogue: 30,0:00:56.45,0:01:00.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,of this otherworlder woman \Nwho attacked Ataraxia, Grabel.
Dialogue: 30,0:01:00.96,0:01:03.08,Dialogue,R,0,0,0,,What's most important now
Dialogue: 30,0:01:03.08,0:01:07.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,is that the enemy's target was Aine and her Zeros.
Dialogue: 30,0:01:07.42,0:01:10.34,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,Why would they be after Aine and her Zeros?
Dialogue: 30,0:01:10.34,0:01:13.01,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,Aine, any idea why?
Dialogue: 30,0:01:14.35,0:01:15.30,Dialogue,A,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 30,0:01:15.30,0:01:17.10,Dialogue,A,0,0,0,,I'd like to know myself.
Dialogue: 30,0:01:19.31,0:01:20.10,Dialogue Italics,K,0,0,0,,Aine...
Dialogue: 30,0:01:21.10,0:01:25.77,Dialogue,R,0,0,0,,To take back Japan, we need to close both the Tokyo and Okinawa Entrances.
Dialogue: 30,0:01:26.23,0:01:27.69,Dialogue,R,0,0,0,,We've headed north from Guam,
Dialogue: 30,0:01:27.69,0:01:32.03,Dialogue,R,0,0,0,,and we're currently 500km southeast of Okinawa.
Dialogue: 30,0:01:32.03,0:01:35.03,Dialogue,R,0,0,0,,We'll start by sealing the Okinawa Entrance.
Dialogue: 30,0:01:35.62,0:01:38.04,Dialogue,R,0,0,0,,However, Grabel is there.
Dialogue: 30,0:01:42.08,0:01:45.29,Dialogue,R,0,0,0,,We'll have to defeat her if we want to take back Japan.
Dialogue: 30,0:01:47.04,0:01:48.67,Dialogue,R,0,0,0,,She's strong.
Dialogue: 30,0:01:48.67,0:01:51.51,Dialogue,R,0,0,0,,We'll need a new kind of Hybrid to defeat her:
Dialogue: 30,0:01:51.51,0:01:53.05,Dialogue,R,0,0,0,,the Connective Hybrid.
Dialogue: 30,0:01:53.38,0:01:55.59,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,Connective Hybrid?
Dialogue: 30,0:01:57.30,0:01:59.97,Dialogue Italics,Gi,0,0,0,,A Connective Hybrid is when Eros and two other units
Dialogue: 30,0:01:59.97,0:02:02.56,Dialogue Italics,,0,0,0,,engage in a simultaneous Heart Hybrid.
Dialogue: 30,0:02:03.52,0:02:04.31,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Wow!
Dialogue: 30,0:02:04.81,0:02:06.56,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,In other words...
Dialogue: 30,0:02:07.11,0:02:09.36,Dialogue,GR,0,0,0,,The energy created by this is overwhelming.
Dialogue: 30,0:02:09.36,0:02:11.28,Dialogue,GR,0,0,0,,It allows for a more powerful
Dialogue: 30,0:02:11.28,0:02:14.57,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,offensive energy charge than a normal Heart Hybrid.
Dialogue: 30,0:02:15.49,0:02:17.07,Dialogue,Y,0,0,0,,That sounds fun!
Dialogue: 30,0:02:17.53,0:02:20.83,Dialogue,R,0,0,0,,It's the same as a Climax Hybrid.
Dialogue: 30,0:02:20.83,0:02:22.33,Dialogue,R,0,0,0,,With Connective Hybrid
Dialogue: 30,0:02:22.33,0:02:25.46,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,you'll be able to acquire a more powerful Immoral Weapon.
Dialogue: 30,0:02:26.63,0:02:29.09,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,We'll have to go that far?
Dialogue: 30,0:02:30.05,0:02:32.21,Dialogue,H,0,0,0,,What in the world are you trying to make us do?
Dialogue: 30,0:02:32.21,0:02:34.84,Dialogue,H,0,0,0,,Doing it w-with another girl...
Dialogue: 30,0:02:34.84,0:02:37.34,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I just can't do something so perverted!
Dialogue: 30,0:02:37.72,0:02:41.64,Dialogue,R,0,0,0,,The Heart Hybrid and the Climax Hybrid unite two hearts and bodies
Dialogue: 30,0:02:41.64,0:02:43.81,Dialogue,R,0,0,0,,to allow them to share both love and pleasure.
Dialogue: 30,0:02:43.81,0:02:46.98,Dialogue,R,0,0,0,,But if you want to go beyond that and be more efficient,
Dialogue: 30,0:02:46.98,0:02:49.86,Dialogue,R,0,0,0,,a new form of stimulation and a greater feeling of depravity is required.
Dialogue: 30,0:02:50.32,0:02:53.78,Dialogue,R,0,0,0,,The Connective Hybrid makes both possible!
Dialogue: 30,0:02:53.86,0:02:57.20,Dialogue,H,0,0,0,,Th-That's so obscene! It's immoral!
Dialogue: 30,0:02:57.20,0:02:58.62,Dialogue Italics,Gi,0,0,0,,That's not all.
Dialogue: 30,0:02:58.62,0:03:02.62,Dialogue Italics,Gi,0,0,0,,The Connective Hybrid uses \Na new kind of emotional energy
Dialogue: 30,0:03:02.62,0:03:05.12,Dialogue Italics,,0,0,0,,from the previous ones.
Dialogue: 30,0:03:05.12,0:03:08.46,Dialogue Italics,Gi,0,0,0,,Kizuna's love for them
Dialogue: 30,0:03:08.46,0:03:11.13,Dialogue Italics,Gi,0,0,0,,and the friendship and trust between the girls.
Dialogue: 30,0:03:12.59,0:03:15.30,Dialogue Italics,Gi,0,0,0,,The result of these emotions and their combination,
Dialogue: 30,0:03:15.30,0:03:16.88,Dialogue Italics,Gi,0,0,0,,which is impossible with a {normal}Heart Hybrid,
Dialogue: 30,0:03:17.34,0:03:21.89,Dialogue Italics,Gi,0,0,0,,allows for greater power than you would normally attain.
Dialogue: 30,0:03:25.14,0:03:28.40,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,Then, I suggest Julicia and Scarlet.
