Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.98,0:05:37.02,Signs,,0,0,0,,{\fscx98.792\xbord2.96\xshad0\fscy99.966\ybord3\yshad0\fnIdealist Sans\bord0\blur0.45\fscx32.256\fscy32.639\c&H100806&\fax-0.2\frx-1.334\fry8.065\frz12.95\pos(1329.825,298.335)}Mobile Hybrid Special Bath Mk. 26
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.02,0:05:37.07,Signs,,0,0,0,,{\fscx98.792\xbord2.96\xshad0\fscy99.966\ybord3\yshad0\fnIdealist Sans\bord0\blur0.45\fscx32.226\fscy32.609\c&H100806&\fax-0.2\frx-1.334\fry8.065\frz12.95\pos(1329,298.755)}Mobile Hybrid Special Bath Mk. 26
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.07,0:05:37.11,Signs,,0,0,0,,{\fscx98.792\xbord2.96\xshad0\fscy99.966\ybord3\yshad0\fnIdealist Sans\bord0\blur0.45\fscx32.157\fscy32.539\c&H100806&\fax-0.2\frx-1.334\fry8.065\frz12.95\pos(1328.325,299.145)}Mobile Hybrid Special Bath Mk. 26
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.11,0:05:38.23,Signs,,0,0,0,,{\fscx98.792\xbord2.96\xshad0\fscy99.966\ybord3\yshad0\fnIdealist Sans\bord0\blur0.45\fscx32.157\fscy32.539\c&H100806&\fax-0.2\frx-1.334\fry8.065\frz12.95\pos(1327.89,299.34)}Mobile Hybrid Special Bath Mk. 26
Dialogue: 30,0:05:38.48,0:05:42.24,Dialogue,S,0,0,0,,And you didn't say anything about Julicia being here!
Dialogue: 30,0:05:42.24,0:05:45.24,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,If you're both going to power up, \Nthen it's better to do it together, right?
Dialogue: 30,0:05:45.24,0:05:49.75,Dialogue,S,0,0,0,,I-Is this what a H-Heart Hybrid is like?
Dialogue: 30,0:05:50.20,0:05:53.75,Dialogue,Y,0,0,0,,If this is enough make you embarrassed, then you're still a child.
Dialogue: 30,0:05:57.50,0:06:01.34,Dialogue,Y,0,0,0,,{\i1}I'm{\i0} very happy {that }I get to take a bath with Kizuna.
Dialogue: 30,0:06:02.59,0:06:03.76,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,But, Julicia,
Dialogue: 30,0:06:04.18,0:06:07.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,it's kind of bad if you get that close to me.
Dialogue: 30,0:06:09.22,0:06:10.89,Dialogue,S,0,0,0,,Get off each other, you two!
Dialogue: 30,0:06:19.90,0:06:21.61,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,You okay, Scarlet?
Dialogue: 30,0:06:22.99,0:06:24.66,Dialogue,S,0,0,0,,J-Julicia?
Dialogue: 30,0:06:24.95,0:06:28.49,Dialogue,Y,0,0,0,,I want to hear Kizuna's heartbeat, too.
Dialogue: 30,0:06:33.83,0:06:36.42,Dialogue Italics,S,0,0,0,,S-So soft...
Dialogue: 30,0:06:39.59,0:06:42.92,Dialogue,Y,0,0,0,,Your back's pretty sensitive, isn't it?
Dialogue: 30,0:06:45.43,0:06:48.39,Dialogue,S,0,0,0,,It's ticklish, but it feels kinda good...
Dialogue: 30,0:06:52.02,0:06:53.06,Dialogue,S,0,0,0,,Kizuna!
Dialogue: 30,0:06:53.06,0:06:55.31,Dialogue,S,0,0,0,,I don't think I can do this!
Dialogue: 30,0:06:56.10,0:06:58.06,Dialogue,S,0,0,0,,I-I'm also kinda...
Dialogue: 30,0:07:03.57,0:07:05.82,Dialogue,Y,0,0,0,,No, I can't!
Dialogue: 30,0:07:07.32,0:07:09.58,Dialogue,S,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 30,0:07:23.96,0:07:25.72,Dialogue Italics,S,0,0,0,,What is this?
Dialogue: 30,0:07:25.72,0:07:28.09,Dialogue Italics,S,0,0,0,,Something's going on inside me...
Dialogue: 30,0:07:28.09,0:07:30.60,Dialogue Italics,S,0,0,0,,It's so gentle and warm.
Dialogue: 30,0:07:33.47,0:07:35.60,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,Okay, we're moving to the next stage.
Dialogue: 30,0:07:35.98,0:07:39.61,Dialogue,Y,0,0,0,,My whole body feels warm...
Dialogue: 30,0:07:42.07,0:07:44.61,Dialogue,Y,0,0,0,,Take yours off, too, Scarlet.
Dialogue: 30,0:07:46.40,0:07:48.86,Dialogue,S,0,0,0,,K-Kizuna, you, too.
Dialogue: 30,0:07:49.24,0:07:50.45,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,O-Okay...
Dialogue: 30,0:07:56.12,0:07:57.58,Dialogue,Y,0,0,0,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 30,0:07:57.58,0:07:59.75,Dialogue,Y,0,0,0,,Do you want to play with them?
Dialogue: 30,0:07:59.75,0:08:02.59,Dialogue,S,0,0,0,,I-I just l-lost my balance...
Dialogue: 30,0:08:02.92,0:08:03.88,Dialogue,Y,0,0,0,,Oh my.
Dialogue: 30,0:08:03.88,0:08:08.34,Dialogue,Y,0,0,0,,You always used to follow me around and call me Julicia-senpai, right?
Dialogue: 30,0:08:10.09,0:08:13.85,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,I figured that's what you used to be like.
Dialogue: 30,0:08:19.10,0:08:20.85,Dialogue,S,0,0,0,,Wh-What is this?
Dialogue: 30,0:08:21.56,0:08:25.86,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,I asked Shikina-san to get me some old footage of you two.
Dialogue: 30,0:08:26.24,0:08:28.86,Dialogue,S,0,0,0,,Why would you do that?
Dialogue: 30,0:08:30.49,0:08:31.87,Dialogue,Y,0,0,0,,Oh, Kizuna...
Dialogue: 30,0:08:38.58,0:08:43.13,Dialogue Italics,S,0,0,0,,That's back when Julicia and I fought together.
Dialogue: 30,0:08:45.63,0:08:47.63,Dialogue Italics,S,0,0,0,,We trained together.
Dialogue: 30,0:08:51.97,0:08:54.14,Dialogue Italics,S,0,0,0,,We laughed together.
Dialogue: 30,0:08:56.68,0:08:58.64,Dialogue Italics,S,0,0,0,,We cried together.
Dialogue: 30,0:09:02.06,0:09:04.61,Dialogue,S,0,0,0,,Julicia-senpai...
Dialogue: 30,0:09:11.70,0:09:14.16,Dialogue,S,0,0,0,,You weren't the kind of person who'd do that.
Dialogue: 30,0:09:14.83,0:09:16.41,Dialogue,S,0,0,0,,You wouldn't betray us.
Dialogue: 30,0:09:16.41,0:09:18.95,Dialogue,S,0,0,0,,You wouldn't use us as pawns.
Dialogue: 30,0:09:18.95,0:09:20.16,Dialogue,S,0,0,0,,So why?
Dialogue: 30,0:09:21.29,0:09:22.71,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,Julicia.
Dialogue: 30,0:09:22.71,0:09:26.17,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,You didn't actually know the Dragorie was going to show up, did you?
Dialogue: 30,0:09:36.10,0:09:36.93,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,Answer me, Julicia.
Dialogue: 30,0:09:42.60,0:09:46.57,Dialogue,Y,0,0,0,,The enemy had attacked an urban area.
Dialogue: 30,0:09:47.02,0:09:48.86,Dialogue,Y,0,0,0,,There was a risk that Scarlet's missiles
Dialogue: 30,0:09:48.86,0:09:53.07,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,could miss them and hit the town and the people.
Dialogue: 30,0:09:53.07,0:09:56.45,Dialogue,Y,0,0,0,,If civilians died because of that,
Dialogue: 30,0:09:56.45,0:09:58.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I didn't think she'd ever recover.
Dialogue: 30,0:09:58.37,0:09:59.08,Dialogue,Y,0,0,0,,So...
Dialogue: 30,0:10:00.91,0:10:04.83,Dialogue,Y,0,0,0,,I lied to get her and the others away.
Dialogue: 30,0:10:05.96,0:10:06.79,Dialogue,S,0,0,0,,You lied?
Dialogue: 30,0:10:08.09,0:10:11.38,Dialogue,Y,0,0,0,,I hear there's an enemy attack from a new Entrance!
Dialogue: 30,0:10:12.72,0:10:15.26,Dialogue,Y,0,0,0,,I'll stay here to fight the enemy.
Dialogue: 30,0:10:15.26,0:10:16.43,Dialogue,Y,0,0,0,,So you...
Dialogue: 30,0:10:16.43,0:10:17.47,Dialogue,S,0,0,0,,Okay!
Dialogue: 30,0:10:17.76,0:10:19.56,Dialogue,S,0,0,0,,I'll head there now!
Dialogue: 30,0:10:22.73,0:10:26.36,Dialogue,Y,0,0,0,,I never imagined the enemy would really appear there.
Dialogue: 30,0:10:32.90,0:10:37.53,Dialogue,Y,0,0,0,,But it's a fact that in the end\N I took all the credit for myself,
Dialogue: 30,0:10:37.53,0:10:42.12,Dialogue,Y,0,0,0,,and used you to become a super ace.
Dialogue: 30,0:10:47.21,0:10:48.42,Dialogue Italics,S,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 30,0:10:48.42,0:10:53.13,Dialogue Italics,S,0,0,0,,She hadn't been attacked by the Dragorie even once.
Dialogue: 30,0:10:53.51,0:10:57.14,Dialogue Italics,S,0,0,0,,She was hurt because she'd been fighting the other enemies on her own.
Dialogue: 30,0:10:57.72,0:11:00.64,Dialogue Italics,S,0,0,0,,And she came for us anyway!
Dialogue: 30,0:11:21.83,0:11:24.62,Dialogue,Y,0,0,0,,Now, let's attack Kizuna together.
Dialogue: 30,0:11:27.58,0:11:28.96,Dialogue,Y,0,0,0,,Okay, Kizuna.
Dialogue: 30,0:11:28.96,0:11:31.29,Dialogue,Y,0,0,0,,Grab us both tight!
Dialogue: 30,0:11:31.67,0:11:32.34,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,Okay!
Dialogue: 30,0:11:37.05,0:11:38.93,Dialogue,Y,0,0,0,,Say, does that feel good?
Dialogue: 30,0:11:40.89,0:11:42.01,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,Yeah...
Dialogue: 30,0:11:42.01,0:11:45.18,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,Of course it feels good.
Dialogue: 30,0:11:45.18,0:11:48.31,Dialogue,S,0,0,0,,Kizuna, don't forget about me, either.
Dialogue: 30,0:12:08.87,0:12:11.08,Dialogue Italics,K,0,0,0,,I need to make them feel good, too.
Dialogue: 30,0:12:17.97,0:12:19.47,Dialogue,S,0,0,0,,A... Amazing!
Dialogue: 30,0:12:20.26,0:12:22.60,Dialogue,S,0,0,0,,No... No more!
Dialogue: 30,0:12:28.27,0:12:29.14,Dialogue Italics,K,0,0,0,,Okay!
Dialogue: 30,0:12:29.14,0:12:31.02,Dialogue Italics,K,0,0,0,,The Connective Hybrid's almost complete!
Dialogue: 30,0:12:40.74,0:12:44.83,Dialogue,Y,0,0,0,,Kizuna, I feel weird!
Dialogue: 30,0:12:44.83,0:12:45.99,Dialogue,Y,0,0,0,,I don't know what's going on!
Dialogue: 30,0:12:45.99,0:12:50.12,Dialogue,S,0,0,0,,There's an ache inside my body...
Dialogue: 30,0:12:50.12,0:12:53.50,Dialogue,S,0,0,0,,I want to feel you closer to me...
Dialogue: 30,0:13:03.01,0:13:05.35,Dialogue,Y,0,0,0,,Okay, which will you choose?
Dialogue: 30,0:13:05.35,0:13:07.27,Dialogue,Y,0,0,0,,We recommend both.
Dialogue: 30,0:13:11.98,0:13:14.82,Dialogue Italics,K,0,0,0,,Who do I pick? Julicia? Scarlet?
Dialogue: 30,0:13:15.44,0:13:18.28,Dialogue Italics,K,0,0,0,,Don't panic. Think calmly.
Dialogue: 30,0:13:18.74,0:13:20.20,Dialogue Italics,K,0,0,0,,This is a Connective Hybrid.
Dialogue: 30,0:13:20.74,0:13:23.78,Dialogue Italics,K,0,0,0,,You can't just choose one!
Dialogue: 30,0:13:47.64,0:13:48.85,Dialogue,S,0,0,0,,What is this?
Dialogue: 30,0:13:48.85,0:13:51.06,Dialogue,S,0,0,0,,I can feel the power filling me up...
Dialogue: 30,0:13:51.39,0:13:53.98,Dialogue,Y,0,0,0,,This is a Climax Hybrid.
Dialogue: 30,0:13:53.98,0:13:56.69,Dialogue,Y,0,0,0,,No, it's a Connective Hybrid, isn't it?
Dialogue: 30,0:13:59.53,0:14:01.78,Dialogue Italics,R,0,0,0,,Looks like it worked, Kizuna.
Dialogue: 30,0:14:01.78,0:14:02.70,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 30,0:14:03.11,0:14:06.07,Dialogue Italics,R,0,0,0,,Today, we'll be splitting into \Ntwo teams for this operation.
Dialogue: 30,0:14:06.07,0:14:10.20,Dialogue Italics,R,0,0,0,,We'll attack Grabel and seal\N the Entrance at the same time.
Dialogue: 30,0:14:10.45,0:14:11.45,Dialogue,All,0,0,0,,Roger!
Dialogue: 30,0:14:13.12,0:14:14.08,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,Let's go!
Dialogue: 30,0:14:14.08,0:14:14.75,Dialogue Alternate,K,0,0,0,,Eros!
Dialogue: 30,0:14:16.84,0:14:17.63,Dialogue Alternate,Y,0,0,0,,Kuros!
Dialogue: 30,0:14:19.25,0:14:20.09,Dialogue Alternate,S,0,0,0,,Ares!
Dialogue: 30,0:14:22.38,0:14:24.18,Dialogue,S,0,0,0,,H-Hey, Julicia...
Dialogue: 30,0:14:24.93,0:14:25.97,Dialogue,Y,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 30,0:14:26.26,0:14:29.10,Dialogue,S,0,0,0,,If you really want,
Dialogue: 30,0:14:29.10,0:14:32.48,Dialogue,S,0,0,0,,I can let you be leader of the Masters.
Dialogue: 30,0:14:34.69,0:14:38.23,Dialogue,Y,0,0,0,,You're the leader of the Masters, aren't you, Scarlet?
Dialogue: 30,0:14:40.73,0:14:42.99,Dialogue,Y,0,0,0,,And, right now,
Dialogue: 30,0:14:42.99,0:14:46.07,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm Julicia Farandoll of Amaterasu.
Dialogue: 30,0:14:51.54,0:14:53.75,Dialogue,Gi,0,0,0,,We're ready to go whenever.
Dialogue: 30,0:14:53.75,0:14:56.50,Dialogue,Gi,0,0,0,,No, this time they'll come to us.
Dialogue: 30,0:14:56.75,0:14:59.13,Dialogue,Gi,0,0,0,,They'll come. I know it.
Dialogue: 30,0:15:03.09,0:15:04.01,Dialogue,Gi,0,0,0,,They're here?
Dialogue: 30,0:15:07.68,0:15:09.51,Dialogue,Gi,0,0,0,,I've been waiting for you!
Dialogue: 30,0:15:10.47,0:15:13.02,Dialogue,Gi,0,0,0,,I'll take good care of you.
Dialogue: 30,0:15:13.31,0:15:14.98,Dialogue,A,0,0,0,,You're Grabel, right?
Dialogue: 30,0:15:14.98,0:15:17.02,Dialogue,A,0,0,0,,I want to ask you something.
Dialogue: 30,0:15:17.35,0:15:18.48,Dialogue,Gi,0,0,0,,Ask me what?
Dialogue: 30,0:15:18.48,0:15:21.73,Dialogue,A,0,0,0,,Why are you trying to take me with you?
Dialogue: 30,0:15:21.73,0:15:24.03,Dialogue,Gi,0,0,0,,Silver hair, red eyes.
Dialogue: 30,0:15:24.03,0:15:26.45,Dialogue,Gi,0,0,0,,And the Zeros you wield.
Dialogue: 30,0:15:26.45,0:15:27.03,Dialogue,Gi,0,0,0,,You're—
Dialogue: 30,0:15:30.24,0:15:31.99,Dialogue,Y,0,0,0,,Aine, are you okay?
Dialogue: 30,0:15:31.99,0:15:34.04,Dialogue,S,0,0,0,,Let us handle those two!
Dialogue: 30,0:15:34.29,0:15:37.83,Dialogue,Y,0,0,0,,We'll pay them back for last time!
Dialogue: 30,0:15:37.83,0:15:40.54,Dialogue,Y,0,0,0,,You defend the Entrance sealing system!
Dialogue: 30,0:15:40.54,0:15:43.55,Dialogue,Y,0,0,0,,There are too many of them for Kizuna and the others.
Dialogue: 30,0:15:43.80,0:15:44.80,Dialogue,A,0,0,0,,Fine!
Dialogue: 30,0:15:45.55,0:15:47.09,Dialogue,Gu,0,0,0,,I won't let you go.
Dialogue: 30,0:15:51.30,0:15:52.81,Dialogue,Y,1200,0,0,,Scarlet!
Dialogue: 30,0:15:52.81,0:15:53.81,Dialogue,S,0,1200,0,,Roger!
Dialogue: 30,0:15:57.56,0:15:58.94,Dialogue,S,0,0,0,,Shoot!
Dialogue: 30,0:16:09.45,0:16:10.20,Dialogue,Gi,0,0,0,,So many!
Dialogue: 30,0:16:16.54,0:16:18.08,Dialogue,Y,0,0,0,,My, not bad!
Dialogue: 30,0:16:18.08,0:16:20.58,Dialogue,S,0,0,0,,Now, Julicia! Go ahead!
Dialogue: 30,0:16:21.96,0:16:23.09,Dialogue,Y,0,0,0,,Leave it to me.
Dialogue: 30,0:16:25.59,0:16:27.34,Dialogue,Y,0,0,0,,Cross Head.
Dialogue: 30,0:16:41.02,0:16:42.11,Dialogue,S,0,0,0,,That's...
Dialogue: 30,0:16:43.44,0:16:44.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Julicia's...
Dialogue: 30,0:16:46.61,0:16:48.03,Dialogue,S,0,0,0,,Immoral Weapon!
Dialogue: 30,0:17:09.63,0:17:10.55,Dialogue,Gi,0,0,0,,Aldea!
Dialogue: 30,0:17:13.43,0:17:14.39,Dialogue,S,0,0,0,,Drive!
Dialogue: 30,0:17:30.57,0:17:31.57,Dialogue,S,0,0,0,,You did it!
Dialogue: 30,0:17:31.57,0:17:33.03,Dialogue,S,0,0,0,,You did it, Julicia!
Dialogue: 30,0:17:37.54,0:17:38.66,Dialogue,Y,0,0,0,,I'm...
Dialogue: 30,0:17:38.66,0:17:41.04,Dialogue,Y,0,0,0,,not the type who likes to keep losing.
Dialogue: 30,0:17:41.96,0:17:43.92,Dialogue,S,0,0,0,,You're so amazing, Julicia!
Dialogue: 30,0:17:48.80,0:17:49.55,Dialogue,Y,0,0,0,,No...
Dialogue: 30,0:17:51.13,0:17:53.05,Dialogue,Y,0,0,0,,She survived that?
Dialogue: 30,0:17:56.30,0:17:59.68,Dialogue,Gi,0,0,0,,I will bring my full power to bear against you.
Dialogue: 30,0:18:07.82,0:18:12.07,Dialogue,Gi,0,0,0,,This is my real weapon, the Sword Gatling.
Dialogue: 30,0:18:21.12,0:18:22.08,Dialogue,Y,0,0,0,,Kizuna!
Dialogue: 30,0:18:28.25,0:18:30.59,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,Are you two okay?
Dialogue: 30,0:18:35.14,0:18:37.47,Dialogue,Gi,0,0,0,,You're the man from before?
Dialogue: 30,0:18:39.01,0:18:41.02,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,Why are you trying to take Aine with you?
Dialogue: 30,0:18:41.43,0:18:43.14,Dialogue,Gi,0,0,0,,I see no reason to answer that.
Dialogue: 30,0:18:46.44,0:18:47.48,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,Kuros Mode!
Dialogue: 30,0:18:51.03,0:18:52.24,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,Come, Grabel!
Dialogue: 30,0:18:53.28,0:18:54.36,Dialogue,Gi,0,0,0,,Very well!
Dialogue: 30,0:18:56.53,0:18:59.95,Dialogue Italics,K,0,0,0,,What I need is enough firepower to defeat her weapon.
Dialogue: 30,0:18:59.95,0:19:00.62,Dialogue Italics,K,0,0,0,,A gun,
Dialogue: 30,0:19:00.99,0:19:02.12,Dialogue Italics,K,0,0,0,,a rifle,
Dialogue: 30,0:19:02.12,0:19:03.41,Dialogue Italics,K,0,0,0,,a cannon,
Dialogue: 30,0:19:03.41,0:19:04.75,Dialogue Italics,K,0,0,0,,a machine gun,
Dialogue: 30,0:19:04.75,0:19:05.62,Dialogue Italics,K,0,0,0,,a rail gun,
Dialogue: 30,0:19:05.96,0:19:07.13,Dialogue Italics,K,0,0,0,,a particle gun,
Dialogue: 30,0:19:07.13,0:19:09.50,Dialogue Italics,K,0,0,0,,the Differential Flame...
Dialogue: 30,0:19:09.50,0:19:10.42,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,I want them!
Dialogue: 30,0:19:12.67,0:19:14.09,Dialogue,Gu,0,0,0,,Wh-What?
Dialogue: 30,0:19:14.09,0:19:17.14,Dialogue,Gu,0,0,0,,Is he carrying an entire military unit on his back?
Dialogue: 30,0:19:17.64,0:19:19.64,Dialogue,Gu,0,0,0,,Go, Sword Gatling!
Dialogue: 30,0:19:20.01,0:19:22.56,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,I'm coming, too!
Dialogue: 30,0:19:23.14,0:19:25.81,Dialogue,Y,0,0,0,,Kuros' light...
Dialogue: 30,0:19:28.98,0:19:31.11,Dialogue Italics,Gi,0,0,0,,So I can't overwhelm him with just this?
Dialogue: 30,0:19:41.28,0:19:43.08,Dialogue,Gi,0,0,0,,That's not good enough!
Dialogue: 30,0:19:46.92,0:19:47.92,Dialogue Italics,K,0,0,0,,More!
Dialogue: 30,0:19:47.92,0:19:49.00,Dialogue Italics,K,0,0,0,,I need more!
Dialogue: 30,0:19:49.00,0:19:50.42,Dialogue Italics,K,0,0,0,,I need more firepower...
Dialogue: 30,0:19:50.42,0:19:53.34,Dialogue Italics,K,0,0,0,,Like Scarlet's...
Dialogue: 30,0:19:53.34,0:19:54.51,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,Hybrid Mode!
Dialogue: 30,0:20:02.31,0:20:04.60,Dialogue,S,0,0,0,,Ares' missiles...
Dialogue: 30,0:20:10.23,0:20:13.11,Dialogue Italics,Gi,0,0,0,,How could I... lose...?
Dialogue: 30,0:20:17.11,0:20:18.61,Dialogue,Y,0,0,0,,Kizuna-kun!
Dialogue: 30,0:20:36.80,0:20:38.22,Dialogue,Gi,0,0,0,,Aldea...
Dialogue: 30,0:20:44.18,0:20:46.14,Dialogue,Gi,0,0,0,,We'll leave, for now.
Dialogue: 30,0:20:54.32,0:20:57.40,Dialogue,Gi,0,0,0,,Next time, you will be mine.
Dialogue: 30,0:20:59.57,0:21:01.91,Dialogue,Gi,0,0,0,,All Entrances on Okinawa
Dialogue: 30,0:21:02.24,0:21:03.91,Dialogue,Gi,0,0,0,,have been sealed off.
Dialogue: 30,0:21:04.62,0:21:07.66,Dialogue,Gi,0,0,0,,All enemy unit signals have disappeared, as well.
Dialogue: 30,0:21:08.08,0:21:11.92,Dialogue,Gi,0,0,0,,Amaterasu, and Scarlet of the Masters, are all safe.
Dialogue: 30,0:21:13.00,0:21:14.46,Dialogue,R,0,0,0,,Victory is ours!
Dialogue: 30,0:21:16.55,0:21:17.80,Dialogue,Y,0,0,0,,We did it, Kizuna!
Dialogue: 30,0:21:18.26,0:21:20.09,Dialogue,Y,0,0,0,,You were so cool!
Dialogue: 30,0:21:20.09,0:21:20.88,Dialogue,S,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 30,0:21:20.88,0:21:22.68,Dialogue,S,0,0,0,,Get away from him!
Dialogue: 30,0:21:23.64,0:21:25.43,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,Yeah, it's thanks to all of you.
Dialogue: 30,0:21:26.26,0:21:28.60,Dialogue,H,0,0,0,,You actually did it with two girls at once...
Dialogue: 30,0:21:28.60,0:21:29.68,Dialogue,H,0,0,0,,How perverted!
Dialogue: 30,0:21:29.68,0:21:31.69,Dialogue,S,0,0,0,,N-No, it wasn't...
Dialogue: 30,0:21:31.69,0:21:34.19,Dialogue,Y,0,0,0,,Oh, then what was it?
Dialogue: 30,0:21:34.19,0:21:35.69,Dialogue,S,0,0,0,,Just get away from him!
Dialogue: 30,0:21:36.65,0:21:39.69,Dialogue Flashback,Gi,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,450)}Next time, you will be mine.
Dialogue: 30,0:21:42.28,0:21:45.07,Dialogue Italics,A,0,0,0,,Just who am I?
